 href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">CINE_LOOT_GEN_Amulet_Wulbren_A_Hanging_A_Blood_Speckeled_A</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:CINE_LOOT_GEN_Amulet_Wulbren_A_Hanging_A_Blood_Speckeled_A\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:CINE_LOOT_GEN_Amulet_Wulbren_A_Hanging_A_Blood_Speckeled_A\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">b0a0af0b-6642-4713-b884-6e09fd79d2c9</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b0a0af0b-6642-4713-b884-6e09fd79d2c9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:b0a0af0b-6642-4713-b884-6e09fd79d2c9\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">ARM_Amulet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_Amulet+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:ARM_Amulet+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The <b>Bloody Amulet</b> can be obtained from <a href=\"/wiki/Barcus_Wroot\" title=\"Barcus Wroot\">Barcus Wroot</a>, who can be met in several different locations:\n<ul><li>Tied to the windmill in <a href=\"/wiki/Blighted_Village\" title=\"Blighted Village\">Blighted Village</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;0&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;425</span></li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a>, if been freed from the windmill</li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Campsite\" title=\"Campsite\">Camp</a>, if been encountered in <a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a> and asked to join as a <a href=\"/wiki/Camp_Follower\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Camp Follower\">Camp Follower</a></li>\n<li>In <a href=\"/wiki/Last_Light_Inn\" title=\"Last Light Inn\">Last Light</a>, if he survives into <a href=\"/wiki/Act_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Act 2\">Act 2</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Casting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/38px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/50px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Speak with Dead\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp/25px-Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Speak_with_Dead_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Speak_with_Dead\" title=\"Speak with Dead\">Speak with Dead</a> on Barcus reveals, that he found this amulet bloodied while searching for his friend <a href=\"/wiki/Wulbren\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wulbren\">Wulbren</a>.</li>\n<li>As of Patch #7, this item does not appear to have any quest significance.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201601\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1982/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31848/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8303/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.017/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1175524/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   59.994      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n100.00%   59.994      1 -total\n 28.21%   16.924      6 Template:Uid\n 24.00%   14.400      5 Template:Icon_text\n 22.74%   13.642     20 Template:Trim\n 16.90%   10.137      2 Template:Icon_link\n 15.50%    9.301      4 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 14.74%    8.841      1 Template:WeaponType\n 14.39%    8.635      6 Template:Ifempty\n 12.12%    7.270      6 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:3598-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201601 and revision id 361460. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}